# Vendored decent-player USB audio driver. The build-required modules under
# libs/ are tracked (decent-usb-audio-driver, decent-usb-audio-wrapper-media3,
# and the FLAC decoder module, which the driver's CMakeLists.txt compiles
# libFLAC + flac_parser.cc from — a fresh clone must have it). The nested repo's
# docs/driver/player dirs and its root metafiles are excluded; the modules' build
# output is covered by the nested .gitignore. Nested repo history is preserved in
# a git bundle (third_party/decent-player/.git was removed).
/third_party/decent-player/.git/
/third_party/decent-player/driver/
/third_party/decent-player/docs/
/third_party/decent-player/player/
/third_party/decent-player/CONTRIBUTING.md
/third_party/decent-player/LICENSE
/third_party/decent-player/NOTICE.md
/third_party/decent-player/README.md
